{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09577","headline":"宿华阴东郭客舍忆阎防 · 岑参","name":"宿华阴东郭客舍忆阎防","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"次舍山郭近，解鞍鸣钟时。\n主人炊新粒，行子充夜饥。\n关月生首阳，照见华阴祠。\n苍茫秋山晦，萧瑟寒松悲。\n久从园庐别，遂与朋知辞。\n旧壑兰杜晚，归轩今已迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}